B. INJECTION RECOVERY for material_bpix_support6  (physical units)
================================================================================================
   SIGN: the injection scales that group's exponents by exp(+k) in the CARD, i.e.
   it declares the model at k = 0 to already have exp(k) times the material, so
   the MLE moves by -k.  What is tested is |shift| against |truth|.
   PRIOR SHRINKAGE: the group carries its tier prior, and the injection is about
   one prior sigma, so the POSTERIOR only moves by a fraction
   f = sigma_post^2 / sigma_lik^2 of it, with 1/sigma_lik^2 = 1/sigma_post^2 - 1/sigma_pri^2.
   The prior-corrected column divides the shift by that f.
